      "explanation": "The dgxspark f16 source is the 2026-09-27 producer (its minfer commit was never recorded); the Mac's was regenerated 2026-10-07 at master ab34a72. The f16 source therefore differs, and the --pure BF16 cast *of that source* differs with it. The pair that isolates this is ref/qwen2.5-0.5b-bf16-from-f32.gguf: its input is the f32 conversion, which is byte-identical on both boxes, and the cast is byte-identical too — so the divergence is the minfer producer version, not the platform and not llama.cpp. Settling it needs the recorded minfer commit per fixture (issue #205).",
